"""Chapter edits for P64–P68, as (kind, anchor, text) edits applied by apply_docs.py.

kind: 'before' inserts text before the line starting with anchor (a blank line after a paragraph,
none after a list item or table row); 'after_line' inserts text as new lines after the line starting
with anchor; 'replace' replaces the exact substring anchor with text. Every anchor must occur once.
Placeholders {LEAN}, {STUDY_<MODULE>}, {S_<MODULE>} and {N_<MODULE>} are filled by apply_docs.py.
"""

ATT_ZH = '**吸引（第一部分，P67）。** 一般因果系统的说明列出路径依赖与吸引子；在脊柱上，两者是同一条规律，对每个确定的律成立，不加前提（[Becoming.Attraction]({LEAN}/Attraction.lean)）。律从不离开的区域是吸收区域（`Law.Absorbing`）；其外的配置若轨道进入它，就被吸入它（`Law.DrawnInto`），被吸入者构成它的吸引域。被吸入者不再回来（`Law.DrawnInto.never_back`）；而且配置被某个吸收区域吸入，恰当它不返回（`Law.drawn_iff_not_returns`）：它的前方就是一个它在第一步进入的吸收区域。未来收窄：n 步后可得者构成吸收区域，到第 n 步丧失的每个可能都被吸入它（`Law.reachable_absorbing`、`Law.lost_drawn`）。被合并的两个配置不都返回，这不需要有限性（`Law.Merges.not_both_return`），所以不都逃过被吸入；哪一个被吸入需要判定，只以双重否定陈述（`Law.merge_draws`）。有限多配置之内，吸引即合并：有配置被吸入，律就合并并丧失一个可能，相等可判定时两者等价；返回者的区域吸入其余一切（`Law.Drawn.not_lossless`、`Law.lossless_iff_none_drawn`、`Law.drawnInto_returning`）。开放的世界把两者分开：往上数吸入而不合并，往下数吸入而保留每个可能（`Law.succ_drawn_lossless`、`Law.pred_drawn_keeps`）。对每个过程，进入不变区域之后，其外的配置不再可达（`Invariant.locks_out`）；区域不变，恰当每个动作都保持它，离开需要一个不保持它的动作（`invariant_iff_every_move`、`Run.leaving_needs`、`Exit`）。读法（AI 的，待 Ren）：锁定就是不返回；未来收窄，吸引子是展开收窄自己的未来；Capture 中规则所持的结果是规则中的吸收区域。主律近乎定义，所复用的是有限集上轨道最终周期的数学；实际展开进入哪些区域、吸引域多深多宽，都不推出。见[研究 §{S_ATTRACTION}]({STUDY_ATTRACTION})与 [attraction-is-not-returning](../results/records/attraction-is-not-returning.md)。'

ATT_EN = "**Attraction (Part I, P67).** The account of a general cause–effect system lists path dependence and attractors; on the spine they are one law, holding of every determined law with no premise (`Becoming.Attraction`). A region the law never leaves is absorbing; a configuration outside it whose course enters it is drawn into it, and what is drawn in is its basin. What is drawn in never comes back, and a configuration is drawn into some absorbing region exactly where it does not return: what lies ahead of it is an absorbing region it enters at the first step. The future narrows: what can be had `n` steps on is absorbing, and every possibility lost by step `n` is drawn into it. Of two configurations a law merges, not both return, with no finiteness, so not both escape being drawn; which one is drawn needs deciding and is stated only in double-negation form. Within finitely many configurations attraction is merging: a drawn configuration means a merge and a lost possibility, the two are equivalent where equality is decidable, and what returns draws in everything else. An open world separates them: counting on draws without merging, counting down draws while keeping every possibility. Under every process, once inside an invariant region, what lies outside cannot be had again; a region is invariant exactly where every move keeps it, and leaving it needs a move that does not. On the AI's reading, pending Ren, lock-in is not returning, an attractor is the unfolding narrowing its own future, and Capture's held rule is an absorbing region in the rule. The main law is close to definitional, and the mathematics reused is eventual periodicity on finite sets; which regions actual unfoldings enter, and how deep or wide a basin is, are not derived."

RES_ZH = '**其余回应时的比较（第一部分，P65）。** 以扣留水平的比较固定其余交换；任意两个流的比较在其差别所及之内决定，却不说差别能到哪里。本模块陈述其余经识回应时差别能到哪里（[Becoming.Response]({LEAN}/Response.lean)）。一个形成在部分的回应所及之内，是指它在某个成员对经所识者影响的闭包之内：成员在两个流之一中与它所识的条件交换，或经这样的环节逐环到达（`Flow.WithinResponse`）。部分之外的每个形成，凡直到某步识得相同，在该步的交换在两个流中相同，就说其余经识回应（`Flow.RespondsThroughRegistration`）；这是给出的前提，不由动力学推出，其余固定是它的情形（`Flow.respondsThroughRegistration_withhold`）。在这一前提下，两个流在场形成相同、在回应所及之外者所识的条件上平衡且起始相同时，回应所及之外的每个形成每步识得相同、交换相同（`Flow.alike_beyond_response`，`Flow.alike_within_closed` 的实例），两个流的差别到不了它（`Flow.not_differs_beyond_response`）；所以对两个平衡、起始相同的流，覆盖一切不在回应所及之外者的任何意义，都作公理的比较（`Flow.Balances.comparison_within_response`）。回应所及与识闭包对偶（`Flow.withinResponse_iff_registration`），含部分所到达的与每个成员的所及闭包；只识支持、一个流时，它恰是成员所及闭包之并（`Flow.withinResponse_supportOnly_iff`）。营养级联中鹿经其支持回应：森林在狼群的回应所及之内，而狼群的部分到达不了它；回应所及恰是狼群、鹿与森林，有回应的比较在它们之间决定（`Trophic.within_response_iff`、`Trophic.responsive_comparison`）。`Loop` 中部分的动作改变另一个形成所识的，后者回应，差别回到部分自身的支持，而部分自身的交换从不到达那里（`Loop.returns`）。读法（AI 的，待 Ren）：一个动作有两种反事实，其余固定时只计部分直接到达的，其余经识回应时计回应所及；升级回路是每一方都经识回应、差别回到部分的情形；只识支持时，所及闭包就是一个动作的差别在其余经支持回应时能到之处。形成只经其识回应、怎样回应、差别到达多少，都不推出。见[研究 §{S_RESPONSE}]({STUDY_RESPONSE})与 [comparison-where-the-rest-responds](../results/records/comparison-where-the-rest-responds.md)。'

RES_EN = "**The comparison where the rest responds (Part I, P65).** The comparison by withheld levels keeps the rest of the exchange fixed, and the comparison of any two flows is decided within what their difference reaches, without saying where that difference can go (`Becoming.Response`). A formation lies within a part's responsive reach when it lies within some member's closure under affecting through what is registered: a member exchanges, in one of the two flows, with a condition the formation registers, or reaches it by such links (`Flow.WithinResponse`). The rest responds through its registration when every formation outside the part exchanges alike in the two flows across each step up to which it has registered alike (`Flow.RespondsThroughRegistration`); this is a supplied premise, not derived from the dynamics, and the rest held fixed is a case of it (`Flow.respondsThroughRegistration_withhold`). Under it, with the same formations present, balance and a common start on what the formations beyond the responsive reach register, each of them registers alike and exchanges alike at every step (`Flow.alike_beyond_response`, an instance of `Flow.alike_within_closed`), and the difference between the flows reaches none of them (`Flow.not_differs_beyond_response`). So for two balanced flows starting alike, any significance covering every formation not beyond the responsive reach compares them as the axiom does (`Flow.Balances.comparison_within_response`). The responsive reach is the dual of the registration closure (`Flow.withinResponse_iff_registration`) and holds what the part reaches and each member's reach closure; registering support only, with one flow, it is exactly the union of the members' reach closures (`Flow.withinResponse_supportOnly_iff`). In the trophic cascade the deer respond through their support: the forest lies within the wolves' responsive reach, which their part does not reach, and the reach is exactly the wolves, the deer and the forest, among which the responsive comparison is decided (`Trophic.within_response_iff`, `Trophic.responsive_comparison`). In `Loop` a part's act changes what another formation registers, the other responds, and the difference returns to the part's own support, which the part's own exchange never reaches (`Loop.returns`). On the AI's reading, pending Ren, an act has two counterfactuals: with the rest fixed only what the part reaches directly counts, and with the rest responding through its registration the responsive reach counts; an escalation loop is the case where each party responds through its registration and the difference returns to the part; registering support only, the reach closure is where the difference an act makes can arrive when the rest responds through its support. That formations respond only through their registration, how they respond and how much difference arrives are not derived."

MEC_ZH = '**机制（第一部分，P66）。** 实验需要一个关于何者无关的模型（P53）；这里说这样的模型何时存在（[Becoming.Mechanism]({LEAN}/Mechanism.lean)）。配置的一个投影 π 是一个描述。某个描述上的确定过程容许每一步经 π 读，恰当相同者同去：经 π 相同的两个配置，以同一动作到达经 π 相同的配置（`carries_law_iff`）；步骤经 π 读的像是唯一需要检查的候选（`Image.least`、`image_determined_iff`）。这不加前提，对每个过程成立；经恒等它就是确定性（`goAlike_id_iff`）。规律可以在较粗的描述上而不在整体上（`Coarse`），也可以在整体上而不在较粗的描述上（`Switching`）；不分任何东西的描述总承载规律（`goAlike_const`），所以内容在于哪个描述承载它。下一配置只依于 π 时，所不依者一步之内被重新吸收（`DependsOnlyOn.reabsorbed`），规则持有结果（`Law.reform_reabsorbed`）是它以规则为投影的实例。状态与规则一起前进的系统是联合配置上的一个确定过程，状态恰在规则对它不造成差别之处有自己的规律（`adaptive_state_law_iff`）；规则改变自己时，状态可以没有任何规律（`Switching.no_state_law`）。经投影的规律，即使是真的，也只在取过之处被记录固定（`Run.not_fixesThrough_of_goAlike`）。读法（AI 的，待 Ren）：机制是承载规律的投影；涌现是较粗描述上的相同者同去；改变自身因果的系统不需要另一种规律，它的规律在联合配置上。见[研究 §{S_MECHANISM}]({STUDY_MECHANISM})与 [projection-carrying-a-law](../results/records/projection-carrying-a-law.md)。'

MEC_EN = "**Mechanism (Part I, P66).** Experiment needs a model of what is irrelevant (P53); this states when such a model exists. A projection of the configuration is a description. Some determined process on the description admits every step read through it exactly where configurations alike under it go alike under it, and the step's image through the projection is the only candidate to check. This holds of every process with no premise, and through the identity it is determinacy. A law can hold at a coarser description and not at the whole, or at the whole and not at a coarser description; the description that distinguishes nothing always carries one, so the content lies in which description carries it. Where the next configuration depends only on the projection, what it does not depend on is re-absorbed in one step, and the rule holding the outcome is its instance with the rule as the projection. A system whose state goes on under a rule that itself goes on is one determined process on the joint configuration; the state has a law of its own exactly where the rule makes no difference to it, and where the rule changes itself the state can have no law at all. A law through a projection, even a true one, is fixed by the record only where taken. On the AI's reading, pending Ren, a mechanism is a projection that carries a law, emergence is going alike at a coarser description, and a system that changes its own causality needs no further kind of law: its law is on the joint configuration."

STD_ZH = '**标准因果模型（第一部分，P68）。** x′ = F(x, u, ε) 是动作为输入与噪声的确定过程（`inputs_determined`）。干预是未取的动作：运行没有取过它时，记录不固定它的结果（`inputs_intervention_unfixed`，P53 的实例），模型固定它（`inputs_model_fixes`）。噪声是未表示的动作：忘掉它，过程恰在噪声不造成差别之处仍确定（`forget_inputs_determined_iff`）。读法（AI 的，待 Ren）：干预由模型而不由记录固定；`retarget` 是在一个配置与一个动作上替换一条结构方程。见[研究 §{S_MECHANISM}]({STUDY_MECHANISM})与 [causal-models-as-processes](../results/records/causal-models-as-processes.md)。'

STD_EN = "**Standard causal models (Part I, P68).** x′ = F(x, u, ε) is a determined process whose move is the input and the noise together. An intervention is a move not taken: where the run has not taken it, the record fixes no outcome of it, while the model does. Noise is a move not represented: with it forgotten, the process stays determined exactly where the noise makes no difference. On the AI's reading, pending Ren, an intervention is fixed by a model and not by the record, and retargeting replaces one structural equation at one configuration and move."

SEL_ZH = '**经识的选择（第一部分，P64）。** 一个选择是关于水平历史的任意命题（哪些被保留、被奖励、留下更多后代）；它经选择者之识，是指选择者识得相同的历史被选得相同（[Becoming.Selection]({LEAN}/Selection.lean)，`Web.SelectsThrough`）。两段历史被每个经 `g` 之识的选择选得相同，恰当 `g` 把它们识得相同（`Web.selects_alike_iff`，不加前提）；识得不同之处，`g` 的信念就是把两者分开的选择（`Web.separates`）。所以其余交换固定时，经识闭包内任一形成之识的每个选择，都把有与无闭包之外一个部分的世界选得相同，与闭包内的形成合起来也是如此（`Flow.unselected_beyond_registration`、`Flow.unselected_beyond_registration_all`）。缺口是所及闭包减去识闭包：`Clearing` 中栖居者在清除者的所及闭包之内、识闭包之外，经清除者之识的每个选择在每一步都把清除与不清除的世界选得相同，而栖居者只在其一中被终结（`Clearing.unselected`）；栖居者之识，以及两者合起来的识，把两个世界分开（`Clearing.selected_by_dweller`、`Clearing.selected_pooled`）。`Diversion` 中，伸出识闭包之外、从栖居者所依存的来源取用而抬高所识存储的流，被经取用者之识的选择选中，克制的流不被选中；经其识的每个选择又分不出它与不伸出的抬高（`Diversion.favours`、`Diversion.blind_to_source`）。选择给它所成立的亲代更多后代时，它们在后代中的份额上升，这是 `share_rises` 的应用（`share_rises_through`）。读法（AI 的，待 Ren）：任何由所识决定的选择（保留、奖励、繁殖、训练）恰及选择者所识，缺口只经依存、观察或他者之识合起来才合上；伸出而抬高所识者之处，选择偏向它；以 AI 训练读，奖励过程是选择者，训练只及奖励所识，AI 把这与 Ren 一篇论文的标题 “When Capability Outruns Correction” 相接。见[研究 §{S_SELECTION}]({STUDY_SELECTION})与 [selection-through-registration](../results/records/selection-through-registration.md)。'

SEL_EN = '**Selection through registration (Part I, P64).** A selection is any claim about level histories: which are kept, rewarded or leave more descendants. It goes through a selector\'s registration when histories the selector registers alike are selected alike. Two histories are selected alike by every selection through `g`\'s registration exactly when `g` registers them alike, with no premise; where `g` registers them apart, its belief separates them. So, with the rest of the exchange fixed, every selection through the registration of a formation within the registration closure, alone or pooled with others within it, selects the world with and without a part beyond the closure alike. The gap is the reach closure less the registration closure. In `Clearing` the dweller lies within the clearer\'s reach closure and beyond its registration closure: every selection through the clearer\'s registration selects the cleared and the spared world alike at every step, while the dweller is ended in only one, and the dweller\'s registration, alone or pooled with the clearer\'s, separates them. In `Diversion` a flow that reaches beyond the registration closure, taking from the source a dweller depends on to raise a store the taker gauges, is selected through the taker\'s registration over the restrained flow, and every such selection treats it alike with raising the store without reaching beyond. Where a selection gives the parents it holds for more offspring, their share rises among the offspring, an application of `share_rises`. On the AI\'s reading, pending Ren, any selection decided by what registers (keeping, rewarding, reproducing, training) reaches exactly what the selector registers, and the gap closes only through dependence, observation or another\'s registration pooled. Where reaching beyond raises what registers, selection favours it. Read for AI training, a reward process is a selector and training reaches only what the reward registers; the AI connects this with the title of Ren\'s paper "When Capability Outruns Correction".'

ATT_WHOLE_ZH = '- 每个确定的律恰吸入不返回者，被吸入者不再回来；n 步后可得者是吸收区域，每个丧失的可能被吸入它；被合并的两个构型不都返回，不需要有限性；有限多构型之内吸引即合并，返回者的区域吸入其余一切，开放的世界把吸引与合并分开（`Law.drawn_iff_not_returns`、`Law.DrawnInto.never_back`、`Law.lost_drawn`、`Law.Merges.not_both_return`、`Law.drawnInto_returning`、`Law.succ_drawn_lossless`）。每个过程中，进入不变区域之后其外者不再可达，离开需要不保持它的动作（`Invariant.locks_out`、`Run.leaving_needs`）。'

ATT_WHOLE_EN = '- Every determined law draws exactly what does not return, and what is drawn in never comes back; what can be had `n` steps on is absorbing and every lost possibility is drawn into it; of two merged configurations not both return, with no finiteness; within finitely many configurations attraction is merging and what returns draws in everything else, while open worlds separate attraction from merging (`Law.drawn_iff_not_returns`, `Law.DrawnInto.never_back`, `Law.lost_drawn`, `Law.Merges.not_both_return`, `Law.drawnInto_returning`, `Law.succ_drawn_lossless`). Under every process, once inside an invariant region what lies outside cannot be had again, and leaving needs a move that does not keep it (`Invariant.locks_out`, `Run.leaving_needs`).'

WHOLE_II_ZH = '- **机制。** 投影承载确定的规律，恰当经它相同的配置同去（`carries_law_iff`）；下一配置只依于投影时，所不依者一步之内被重新吸收（`DependsOnlyOn.reabsorbed`）；改变自身规则的系统是联合配置上的确定过程，状态恰在规则对它不造成差别之处有自己的规律（`adaptive_state_law_iff`）；标准模型 x′ = F(x, u, ε) 中，干预是未取的动作，记录不固定它，噪声是未表示的动作（`inputs_intervention_unfixed`、`forget_inputs_determined_iff`）。\n- **其余回应时的比较。** 其余经识回应（给出的前提）时，部分回应所及之外的每个形成每步识得相同、交换相同，两个流的差别到不了它，比较在回应所及之内决定（`Flow.alike_beyond_response`、`Flow.not_differs_beyond_response`、`Flow.Balances.comparison_within_response`）；只识支持、一个流时，回应所及是成员所及闭包之并（`Flow.withinResponse_supportOnly_iff`）；差别可以经他者的回应回到部分自身（`Loop.returns`）。\n- **经识的选择。** 两段历史被每个经选择者之识的选择选得相同，恰当选择者把它们识得相同（`Web.selects_alike_iff`）；所以其余交换固定时，经识的选择在识闭包之外不见（`Flow.unselected_beyond_registration`），所及闭包之内、识闭包之外的终结不被选出，他者之识合起来时被选出（`Clearing.unselected`、`Clearing.selected_pooled`）。'

WHOLE_II_EN = "- **Mechanism.** A projection carries a determined law exactly where configurations alike under it go alike (`carries_law_iff`); where the next configuration depends only on the projection, what it does not depend on is re-absorbed in one step (`DependsOnlyOn.reabsorbed`); a system changing its own rule is a determined process on the joint configuration, and the state has a law of its own exactly where the rule makes no difference to it (`adaptive_state_law_iff`); in the standard model x′ = F(x, u, ε) an intervention is a move not taken, unfixed by the record, and noise is a move not represented (`inputs_intervention_unfixed`, `forget_inputs_determined_iff`).\n- **The comparison where the rest responds.** Where the rest responds through its registration (a supplied premise), every formation beyond a part's responsive reach registers alike and exchanges alike at every step, the difference between the flows reaches none of them, and the comparison is decided within the responsive reach (`Flow.alike_beyond_response`, `Flow.not_differs_beyond_response`, `Flow.Balances.comparison_within_response`); registering support only, with one flow, the responsive reach is the union of the members' reach closures (`Flow.withinResponse_supportOnly_iff`); the difference can return to the part through others' responses (`Loop.returns`).\n- **Selection through registration.** Two histories are selected alike by every selection through a selector's registration exactly when the selector registers them alike (`Web.selects_alike_iff`); so, with the rest of the exchange fixed, selection through registration is blind beyond the registration closure (`Flow.unselected_beyond_registration`), and an ending within the reach closure and beyond the registration closure is not selected, while pooled registration selects it (`Clearing.unselected`, `Clearing.selected_pooled`)."

DESC_ZH = '- **描述。** 一个形成用哪个描述，不由动力学决定；不分任何东西的描述总承载规律（`goAlike_const`），承载规律对描述变粗或变细都不单调（`Coarse`、`Switching`），真的机制在未取的投影配置上也不被记录固定（`Run.not_fixesThrough_of_goAlike`）。'

DESC_EN = '- **Descriptions.** Which description a formation uses is not decided by the dynamics; the description that distinguishes nothing always carries a law (`goAlike_const`), carrying a law is monotone neither toward coarser nor toward finer descriptions (`Coarse`, `Switching`), and a true mechanism is not fixed by the record at a projected configuration not yet taken (`Run.not_fixesThrough_of_goAlike`).'

OTHERS_ZH_OLD = '他者有回应的比较须给出第二个流（`Flow.Balances.comparison_within_difference`）。'

OTHERS_ZH_NEW = '他者有回应的比较须给出第二个流（`Flow.Balances.comparison_within_difference`）；其余经识回应时，差别与比较限于部分的回应所及（`Flow.Balances.comparison_within_response`），而回应本身与这一前提仍是给出的。'

OTHERS_EN_OLD = 'a comparison in which others respond needs the second flow supplied (`Flow.Balances.comparison_within_difference`).'

OTHERS_EN_NEW = "a comparison in which others respond needs the second flow supplied (`Flow.Balances.comparison_within_difference`); where the rest responds through its registration, the difference and the comparison stay within the part's responsive reach (`Flow.Balances.comparison_within_response`), while the responses and that premise remain supplied."

OPEN_OLD = '其余交换随之调整的反事实；'

OPEN_NEW = '其余交换随之调整、回应由动力学给出而非另给的反事实（其余经识回应时，差别与比较限于部分的回应所及：[comparison-where-the-rest-responds](../results/records/comparison-where-the-rest-responds.md)）；'

